#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/help.html:7
msgid "How the metadata assistant works"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/help.html:8
msgid ""
"The assistant helps you write better metadata. It suggests; you decide. "
"Nothing is saved or published automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/help.html:10
msgid "Two kinds of help"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/help.html:12
msgid "The completeness check"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/help.html:13
msgid ""
"It runs by itself when you open the page and after you have changed a "
"field, uses no AI and costs nothing. It points out what is missing or "
"looks wrong: an empty recommended field, a very short description, a "
"missing licence, a single keyword. \"To fix\" are gaps; \"tips\" are "
"things that could be better."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/help.html:14
